      "tr": "`digest = hmac.new(secret.encode(), msg, hashlib.sha1).digest()`, `offset = digest[-1] & 0x0F`.",
      "en": "`digest = hmac.new(secret.encode(), msg, hashlib.sha1).digest()`, `offset = digest[-1] & 0x0F`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "`number = int.from_bytes(digest[offset:offset + 4], \"big\") & 0x7FFFFFFF`, sonra `str(number % 10**digits).zfill(digits)`.",
      "en": "`number = int.from_bytes(digest[offset:offset + 4], \"big\") & 0x7FFFFFFF`, then `str(number % 10**digits).zfill(digits)`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\nimport hashlib\nimport hmac\n\n\ndef hotp(secret, counter, digits=6):\n    msg = counter.to_bytes(8, \"big\")\n    digest = hmac.new(secret.encode(), msg, hashlib.sha1).digest()\n    offset = digest[-1] & 0x0F\n    number = int.from_bytes(digest[offset:offset + 4], \"big\") & 0x7FFFFFFF\n    return str(number % 10**digits).zfill(digits)\n\nsecret = \"12345678901234567890\"\nfor counter in range(4):\n    print(counter, hotp(secret, counter))\nprint(hotp(secret, 1, 8))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nimport hashlib\nimport hmac\n\n\ndef hotp(secret, counter, digits=6):\n    msg = counter.to_bytes(8, \"big\")\n    digest = hmac.new(secret.encode(), msg, hashlib.sha1).digest()\n    offset = digest[-1] & 0x0F\n    number = int.from_bytes(digest[offset:offset + 4], \"big\") & 0x7FFFFFFF\n    return str(number % 10**digits).zfill(digits)\n\nsecret = \"12345678901234567890\"\nfor counter in range(4):\n    print(counter, hotp(secret, counter))\nprint(hotp(secret, 1, 8))\n```"
    }
  ],
